[/SPOILER]

[b]2D reference reconstruction[/b]

Ashhorn was reconstructed against a preserved AI-generated turnaround. Earlier and later models share the same quarter-view camera. Facial detail, armor and anatomy remain approximate. The model is static and has no playable encounter.

[SPOILER=Ashhorn reference-to-model reconstruction]

[i]AI concept illustration — Ashhorn: the preserved AI-generated turnaround used as an original design reference.[/i]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/autismoyah-hub/project-gielinor-showcase/83e1b40d52b34bcbe50b5d9662f5a61a37bb2282/images/custom-models/19-concept-reference.png[/img]

