The Fire Giant study reached static comparison and a corrected motion retest after the first animation attempt failed. It is not an approved original NPC or independently authored choreography. Organic modeling and consistent artistic fidelity remain unresolved.

[i]Only review images and original animation previews are included here. Authentic anvil imagery is credited to Jagex; no cache meshes or extracted reference animations are distributed. RuneScape / OSRS belongs to Jagex. Unofficial project, unaffiliated with Jagex.[/i]
